# 1) Purpose and vision\
Cerply helps managers raise their team\'92s capability with short lessons and quick checks delivered where people already work. We start as a service\uc0\u8209 led vendor with a helpful tool. As soon as we can, we flip to a tool\u8209 led product that consultants can scale, and that clients can run on their own. This shift should increase reach and profit.\
\
---\
# 2) Elevator pitch\
\'93Turn what you know into daily, bite\uc0\u8209 size learning that actually sticks. Build a module by prompt or upload, push it into Slack and Teams, and watch the engine adapt to each person. Managers see who\'92s progressing, what\'92s working, and what needs a refresh. Use our Certified catalogue for trusted content, and we\'92ll keep your modules fresh each month.\'94\
\
---\
# 3) Problem we solve\
- Managers struggle to spread new ways of working.  \
- New joiners take too long to get up to speed.  \
- Training is often dull, slow, and soon forgotten.  \
- Leaders need proof that skills are improving.\
\
We solve this by:\
- turning any brief, file, or link into ready modules via a guided agent  \
- pushing practice into the daily flow (Slack, Teams, web)  \
- adapting to each person over time  \
- showing clear progress for people and teams\
\
---\
# 4) Target customers and go\uc0\u8209 to\u8209 market steps\
**Day 0**  \
- Run zero\uc0\u8209 cost **Proof\u8209 of\u8209 Concepts (PoC)** with friendly contacts in financial services to refine the offer and build trust.  \
- Sign up the Cerply Certified community of named experts and use them in marketing.  \
- Start simple events and outreach.\
\
**Day 1**  \
- Land in small pockets inside large financial firms by helping individual managers.\
\
**Day 2**  \
- Offer full company roll\uc0\u8209 outs for small financial firms and start\u8209 ups.\
\
**Day 3**  \
- Serve medium and large financial firms with full company roll\uc0\u8209 outs.\
\
**Day 4**  \
- Extend to other sectors such as health care, engineering, and education.\
\
**Day 5**  \
- Grow through reputation and proof of value.\
\
**Day x**  \
- Consider direct\uc0\u8209 to\u8209 consumer and an extended consulting offer.\
