# 6) Value promise\
- Managers ship new knowledge fast.  \
- Learners get short, fresh, varied practice that meets them at the right level.  \
- Leaders see clear movement in skills and time\uc0\u8209 to\u8209 productivity.  \
- Experts gain reach through the Certified catalogue.\
