# 7) Scope overview (no prioritisation)\
We deliver four core areas plus a service wrap:\
1. **Build** \'97 an intelligent workspace to turn prompts and raw material into modules.  \
2. **Push** \'97 send modules to people in their daily tools; adapt content and difficulty over time.  \
3. **Track** \'97 clear views of progress for people and teams.  \
4. **Certified** \'97 a curated catalogue with review and stamp flow.  \
5. **Service wrap** \'97 we do the first upload and give one free day each month for upkeep.\
\
All of the above is in scope for the first release unless stated otherwise.\
