---\
- Two main stores: **Cerply public** (catalogue, patterns, logs) and **client private** (their content and learner data). Hard walls between them.  \
- Track all learner events with time, item, result, speed, hint use, and confidence (if asked).  \
- Keep raw sources linked to each module and item.  \
- Keep versions forever with roll\uc0\u8209 back.  \
- Clients can request deletion of a person\'92s data. When personal data is deleted, Cerply may retain **anonymous patterns/aggregates** for model and product optimisation.  \
